Package: freightdatajp
Title: Interregional Freight Flow Data for Japan
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Mizuki", "Uchida", , "uchidamizuki@vivaldi.net", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides ready-to-use Japanese interregional freight flow
    data, starting with the interprefectural tables of the Net Freight
    Flow Census (the logistics census) published by the Ministry of Land,
    Infrastructure, Transport and Tourism. The tables are built on demand
    from the published workbooks by 'targets' pipelines bundled with the
    package, and cached via 'tarchives'.
